  "description": "The GoRay Electric Bike is built for compact urban commuting, combining portability, comfort, and reliable everyday performance in a foldable design. Powered by a 350W hub motor and a 36V 7.8Ah removable lithium-ion battery, the GoRay delivers smooth acceleration with speeds of up to 20 MPH and a range of up to 35 miles on pedal assist, making it ideal for commuting, errands, or everyday travel. Designed with three riding modes—Pedal Assist, Throttle, and Manual—along with three pedal assist levels, riders can easily adapt performance based on terrain and riding preference.\nBuilt with a durable carbon steel folding frame, the GoRay offers long-lasting durability while remaining practical for compact storage and transportation. The 16” puncture-resistant tires, dual disc brakes, and integrated front and rear lights help provide a safe and stable riding experience, while the LED display panel keeps key ride information easily accessible. Designed with convenience in mind, the GoRay also features a reversible seat with rear passenger seating capability, front and rear fenders, kickstand, and IPX4 water resistance, making it a versatile e-bike for daily commuting and city riding. Partial assembly required.\n.\n\n20mphTop Speed\n\nUp to 35 miles Range\n\n350W Hub Motor\n\n36V 7.8 Ah",
